===Argentina vs Switzerland===
The two teams had met in six previous matches,<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.fifa.com/worldfootball/statisticsandrecords/headtohead/team1=arg/team2=sui/code=-1/index.html |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20140708194905/http://www.fifa.com/worldfootball/statisticsandrecords/headtohead/team1=arg/team2=sui/code=-1/index.html |url-status=dead |archive-date=8 July 2014 |title=Argentina – Switzerland |publisher=FIFA |access-date=28 June 2014 }}</ref> including in the [[1966 FIFA World Cup]] group stage, won by Argentina 2–0.

The match went to extra time with [[Ángel Di María]] scoring the only goal with two minutes remaining with a side-foot finish from the right of the penalty area after a run and pass from [[Lionel Messi]].<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.theguardian.com/football/2014/jul/01/argentina-switzerland-world-cup-2014-last-16-match-report |title=Argentina's Ángel di María breaks Switzerland's hearts at the death |date=1 July 2014 |work=Guardian |access-date=2 July 2014 }}</ref>
Switzerland had a chance to equalise in injury time but [[Blerim Džemaili]] headed against the post then prodded the rebound wide.<ref>{{cite web |url=https://www.bbc.com/sport/0/football/27990606 |title=Argentina 1 Switzerland 0 |date=1 July 2014 |publisher=BBC Sport |access-date=2 July 2014 }}</ref> Argentina advanced to the quarter-finals to face [[#Argentina vs Belgium|Belgium]].

